    "pillar_1_allergen": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_block": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>01. The Allergen Reality</h3><p>Food allergies are not a lifestyle preference. In the UK alone, over <strong>2.4 million adults</strong> live with confirmed food allergies, and hospital admissions for severe anaphylaxis have surged by <strong>154%</strong> over the past two decades.</p><p>Yet in both retail aisles and commercial hospitality kitchens, allergen-safe alternatives are routinely treated as compromised compromises: packed with unpronounceable chemical binders, devoid of authentic flavour, or confined to a tiny 'free-from' quarantine shelf.</p><p>We formulate every single recipe <strong>completely free from all 14 major regulated allergens</strong> from day one. No peanuts, tree nuts, gluten, dairy, eggs, soy, sesame, mustard, celery, lupin, fish, crustaceans, molluscs, or sulphites. One sauce, universally safe.</p>",
            "margin_top": 2
          }
        }
      },
